msgstr "……在东北房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000320
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000af0
msgid "...in a room to the east."
msgstr "……在东边房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000384
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000b54
msgid "...in a room to the southeast."
msgstr "……在东南房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0003e8
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000bb8
msgid "...in a room to the south."
msgstr "……在南边房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00044c
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000c1c
msgid "...in a room to the southwest."
msgstr "……在西南房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0004b0
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000c80
msgid "...in a room to the west."
msgstr "……在西边房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000514
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000ce4
msgid "...in a room to the northwest."
msgstr "……在西北房间。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000578
msgid "There's a high-skill soldier..."
msgstr "有个高技能士兵……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0005dc
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000d48
msgid "...to the north."
msgstr "……在北边。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000640
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000dac
msgid "...to the northeast."
msgstr "……在东北。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0006a4
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000e10
msgid "...to the east."
msgstr "……在东边。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000708
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000e74
msgid "...to the southeast."
msgstr "……在东南。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00076c
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000ed8
msgid "...to the south."
msgstr "……在南边。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0007d0
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000f3c
msgid "...to the southwest."
msgstr "……在西南。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000834
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000fa0
msgid "...to the west."
msgstr "……在西边。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000898
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001004
msgid "...to the northwest."
msgstr "……在西北。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0008fc
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001068
msgid "...up above."
msgstr "……在上方。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x000960
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0010cc
msgid "...down below."
msgstr "……在下方。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0009c4
msgid "There's an item..."
msgstr "有个道具……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001130
msgid "...but, not here!"
msgstr "……但不在这里！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001194
msgid "...but it's not here!"
msgstr "……不在这！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0011f8
msgid "Come for the prisoner, have you?!"
msgstr "你是来找俘虏的吧？！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00125c
msgid "I-I'll show you where the prisoner is."
msgstr "我、我告诉你俘虏在哪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0012c0
msgid "So THIS is what you're after!"
msgstr "原来你要的是这个！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001324
msgid "I-I'll show you where the item is."
msgstr "我、我告诉你道具在哪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001388
msgid "I-I'll show you where the guard is."
msgstr "我、我告诉你守卫在哪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0013ec
msgid "My comrades... "
msgstr "同伴……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001450
msgid "...are something special."
msgstr "……可不一般。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0014b4
msgid "...are pretty damn average."
msgstr "……其实很普通。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001518
msgid "Try checking to the north."
msgstr "去北边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00157c
msgid "Try checking to the northeast."
msgstr "去东北边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0015e0
msgid "Try checking to the east."
msgstr "去东边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001644
msgid "Try checking to the southeast."
msgstr "去东南边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0016a8
msgid "Try checking to the south."
msgstr "去南边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00170c
msgid "Try checking to the southwest."
msgstr "去西南边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001770
msgid "Try checking to the west."
msgstr "去西边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0017d4
msgid "Try checking to the northwest."
msgstr "去西北边找找看。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001838
msgid "Try checking above."
msgstr "去上方找找。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00189c
msgid "Try checking below."
msgstr "去下方找找。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001900
msgid "There's a highly-skilled soldier around. So I heard, anyway."
msgstr "附近有个身手了得的兵。听说是这样。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0019c8
msgid "I-I have a daughter and she's just turning 5..."
msgstr "我、我还有个女儿，才刚满5岁……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001a2c
msgid "I-I have parents to take care of..."
msgstr "我、我还有父母要养……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001a90
msgid "...Not!"
msgstr "……才怪！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001af4
msgid "Nooo! I don't wanna die!"
msgstr "不要啊！我不想死！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001b58
msgid "Y-you heard about this?"
msgstr "你、你也听说这事了？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001c20
msgid "Killing me won't change anything!"
msgstr "杀了我什么也改变不了！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001c84
msgid "So you're the reason all these men have disappeared..."
msgstr "这么说，那些人失踪都是你干的……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001ce8
msgid "If you're going to kill me, then kill me. I'm no snitch."
msgstr "要杀就杀。我绝不会出卖别人。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001d4c
msgid "I-I'm not even worth killing!"
msgstr "我、我连被杀的价值都没有！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001db0
msgid "Oh, no... Is this it?"
msgstr "哦，不……就这样完了吗？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001e14
msgid "I-I don't know anything..."
msgstr "我、我什么都不知道……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001e78
msgid "You're the one behind all this?"
msgstr "都是你在背后搞鬼？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001f40
msgid "Please, spare me!"
msgstr "求求你，饶了我吧！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x001fa4
msgid "You know, I can get you information..."
msgstr "我能给你情报……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002008
msgid "What do you have to lose, right? Heh heh..."
msgstr "反正你也没啥损失，对吧？嘿嘿……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00206c
msgid "You don't have to do this!"
msgstr "你不必这么做！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0020d0
msgid "I don't think you want to kill me..."
msgstr "我觉得你并不想杀我……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002134
msgid "Not bad."
msgstr "不错。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002198
msgid "Not many people sneak up on me."
msgstr "能悄无声息靠近我的人可不多。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0021fc
msgid "I wouldn't mind joining someone like you."
msgstr "跟着你这样的人，我不介意。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002260
msgid "I, uh, I want to join you!"
msgstr "我、我想加入你们！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0022c4
msgid "Join me and we can take over the world..."
msgstr "跟我联手就能统治世界……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00238c
msgid "You know, I DO have special powers..."
msgstr "我可有特殊能力……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002454
msgid "...Maybe so."
msgstr "……也许吧。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0024b8
msgid "...That's possible."
msgstr "有可能。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00251c
msgid "You can hang from suspension bridges."
msgstr "你可以挂在吊桥上。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002580
msgid "Some places you can only reach with a partner."
msgstr "有些地方得和同伴一起去。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0026ac
msgid "I-I saw a dinosaur around here before."
msgstr "我、我之前在这见过恐龙。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002710
msgid ""
"The faster you press the button with a cardiac\n"
"massage, the faster the person will recover."
msgstr "做心脏按摩时按键越快，\n对方恢复得越快。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0028a0
msgid "Helmets are normally bullet-proof."
msgstr "头盔通常能防弹。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002a30
msgid ""
"I'll tell you what I know.\n"
"Just promise you'll let me go."
msgstr "我把知道的都告诉你。\n只求你放我走。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002a94
msgid "Aaah! Please, just calm down and listen to me!"
msgstr "啊啊！求你冷静下来听我说！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002af8
msgid "I don't wanna die... I don't wanna die!"
msgstr "我不想死……我不想死！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002c88
msgid "You smell nice..."
msgstr "你身上好香……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002cec
msgid "H-hey! Your beard is scratching me..."
msgstr "喂！你胡子扎到我了……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002d50
msgid "I know about you."
msgstr "我知道你。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002db4
msgid "Coward! Fight like a man!"
msgstr "胆小鬼！像个男人一样打！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002e18
msgid "You... Do you have any children?"
msgstr "你……你有孩子吗？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002ee0
msgid "Do you think I'm here because I want to be?!"
msgstr "你以为我是自愿来这儿的吗？！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x002fa8
msgid "What did I ever do to you?"
msgstr "我哪里得罪你了？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00300c
msgid "Ooohhhhh, my stomach... Not now!"
msgstr "哦哦哦，我的肚子……别在这时候啊！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003070
msgid "I'm gonna wet myself here..."
msgstr "我要尿出来了……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0030d4
msgid "Say, don't you think it's about time you got some sleep?"
msgstr "我说，你是不是该去睡一觉了？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003264
msgid "Hold up. Don't I get a last smoke?"
msgstr "等等。不能让我抽最后一根烟吗？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003458
msgid "I'll tell you something you'll wanna hear."
msgstr "我告诉你一件你想听的事。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0034bc
msgid "I never expected to meet you like this…"
msgstr "没想到会这样见到你……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003520
msgid "Could this be fate again?"
msgstr "这又是命运吗？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0035e8
msgid "Hands off the merchandise!"
msgstr "别碰货！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00364c
msgid "Hey! Get your hands away from there!"
msgstr "喂！把手拿开！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003714
msgid "I-I'm on your side! Okay?!"
msgstr "我、我站你这边！行了吧？！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003778
msgid "What are you thinking, at a time like this!"
msgstr "都这时候了，你在想什么！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0037dc
msgid "The beauty of a gun's pure functionality never ceases to amaze me."
msgstr "枪械纯粹功能之美，总令我惊叹不已。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003908
msgid "I don't care what you to do me."
msgstr "你想对我怎样都行。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00396c
msgid "Wh... what's going on...?"
msgstr "怎……怎么回事……？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003a34
msgid "Ever hear the saying, \"Knowledge is universal\"?"
msgstr "听过那句话吗，“知识无国界”？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003afc
msgid "You won't get any items... if you kill someone."
msgstr "杀人就拿不到道具了……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003b60
msgid "CO-OP IN allows you to share weapons and equipment."
msgstr "合作潜入可共享武器与装备。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003bc4
msgid "When you go Snake In, your camo index will change to match the person with the highest index."
msgstr "SNAKE潜入时，迷彩指数会变为与最高者一致。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003c28
msgid "When you go Snake In, you can move with the speed of an advance guard."
msgstr "SNAKE潜入时，能以尖兵速度移动。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003c8c
msgid "When you go Snake In, your shield defense area expands."
msgstr "SNAKE潜入时，盾牌防御范围扩大。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003cf0
msgid "When you go Snake In, your Snake Sync goes up."
msgstr "SNAKE潜入时，SNAKE同步率上升。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003d54
msgid "When you're Snake Synced, your camo index goes up."
msgstr "SNAKE同步时，迷彩指数上升。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003db8
msgid "When you're Snake Synced, your defensive power increases significantly."
msgstr "SNAKE同步时，防御力大幅提升。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003e1c
msgid "The controls can be changed under OPTIONS."
msgstr "可在OPTIONS中更改操作。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003e80
msgid "The words of a hero can inspire the hearts of men."
msgstr "英雄之言能鼓舞人心。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003ee4
msgid "I hear if your level of camaraderie is high, CO-OP effects will also be higher."
msgstr "听说羁绊越高，合作效果越强。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x003fac
msgid "The equipment you have affects your camo index."
msgstr "装备会影响迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004010
msgid "Too much equipment will lower your camo index."
msgstr "装备过多会降低迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004074
msgid "Don't forget water and metal both conduct electricity."
msgstr "别忘了水和金属都导电。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0040d8
msgid "Water and metal should make that weapon of yours more effective."
msgstr "水和金属应该能让你的武器更有效。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0041a0
msgid "You can still use a Fulton recovery... on someone close to death."
msgstr "对濒死之人也能用富尔顿回收……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004204
msgid "Shoot someone's arms and legs to neutralize them more easily."
msgstr "射击手臂和腿能更易制伏敌人。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004268
msgid "There are snipers... up ahead."
msgstr "前方有狙击手……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0042cc
msgid "There's an ambush waiting for you... up ahead."
msgstr "前方有埋伏……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004650
msgid "Let me go! If you don't..."
msgstr "放开我！不然……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004b64
msgid "Please! I don't know anything!"
msgstr "求你了！我什么都不知道！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004bc8
msgid "I swear I don't know anything!"
msgstr "我发誓我什么都不知道！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004c2c
msgid "Ugghhh... Please, let me go..."
msgstr "呃啊……求求你，放了我吧……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004c90
msgid "I'll talk, I'll talk, all right?"
msgstr "我说，我说，行了吧？"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x004d58
msgid "My unit will be here any minute!"
msgstr "我的部队随时会到！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005078
msgid "AI mechs... share certain weak points."
msgstr "AI兵器……有共同的弱点。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0050dc
msgid "Chaff works well against AI mechs."
msgstr "干扰弹对AI兵器很有效。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005208
msgid "Take a good look at the falls... You can see a rainbow."
msgstr "好好看看这瀑布……能看到彩虹。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00526c
msgid "You should go for a chopper's tail."
msgstr "你该瞄准直升机尾部。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0052d0
msgid "Using the surround indicator will help in locating the Chrysalis."
msgstr "用环绕指示器能帮你找到蝶蛹。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0054c4
msgid "If you attack the canopy when fighting a chopper..."
msgstr "和直升机战斗时攻击座舱……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005528
msgid "Grab someone and throw them into a wall... for big damage."
msgstr "抓住人往墙上扔……能造成大伤害。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0055f0
msgid "AUTO AIM makes hold-ups a lot easier."
msgstr "自动瞄准让挟持容易多了。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0056b8
msgid "If you're discovered, quickly take the person out with CQC."
msgstr "被发现就立刻用CQC放倒对方。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00571c
msgid "If someone sees you from a distance, lie down straight away to disappear."
msgstr "如果有人从远处看到你，马上趴下就能消失。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0057e4
msgid "Be sure to use AUTO-AIM if you want an easy time against the kidnapper."
msgstr "想轻松对付绑匪，一定要用自动瞄准。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0058ac
msgid "Just between us..."
msgstr "这话只跟你说……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005910
msgid "If shooting's difficult for you... use AUTO AIM."
msgstr "射击难的话……用自动瞄准。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005974
msgid "AUTO AIM's capabilities... vary by weapon."
msgstr "自动瞄准的性能……因武器而异。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0059d8
msgid "Hold still and your hand will eventually stop shaking."
msgstr "稳住别动，手最终就不抖了。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005a3c
msgid "You can stop your hands from shaking when you shoot by crouching."
msgstr "蹲下射击就能让手不抖。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005b04
msgid "Urrgh! You're pretty good..."
msgstr "呃啊！你挺厉害……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005dc0
msgid "Come near me and there's gonna be hell to pay!"
msgstr "敢靠近我，有你好看的！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x005e24
msgid "Looks like this is the end for me, too..."
msgstr "看来我也到此为止了……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00607c
msgid "L-let go of me!"
msgstr "放、放开我！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006144
msgid "Oh, no, I can feel it coming!"
msgstr "糟了，感觉要来了！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006270
msgid "It's me! What are you doing? That hurts!"
msgstr "是我啊！你干什么？好痛！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0062d4
msgid ""
"Come on, don't you remember?!\n"
"It's me!"
msgstr "喂，你不记得了吗？！\n是我啊！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006720
msgid "S-stop it! I-I can't breathe!"
msgstr "住、住手！我、我喘不过气了！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006784
msgid "(wheeze, wheeze)"
msgstr "（呼哧，呼哧）"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0067e8
msgid "W-who's excited? N-not me!"
msgstr "谁、谁兴奋了？才、才不是我！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00684c
msgid "Urrggh... judo?!"
msgstr "呃啊……柔道？！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0068b0
msgid "This supposed to hurt or something?!"
msgstr "这玩意儿应该会痛吗？！"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006914
msgid "I've got... four items hidden on me."
msgstr "我身上……藏了四件道具。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006978
msgid "Hold-ups... will get you a lot of items."
msgstr "挟持……能拿到很多道具。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0069dc
msgid "Armor-piercing bullets go right through helmets and shields."
msgstr "穿甲弹能直接打穿头盔和盾牌。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006a40
msgid "A ghillie suit won't hide you from night-vision goggles."
msgstr "吉利服躲不过夜视仪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006b08
msgid "I'm the only one guarding this area."
msgstr "这片区只有我一人看守。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006b6c
msgid "You can... drop a cardboard box."
msgstr "你可以……放下纸箱。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006cfc
msgid "Use a cardboard box... for cover against a chopper's downwash."
msgstr "用纸箱……抵挡直升机的下洗气流。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006e8c
msgid "I've heard you can climb on top of a cardboard box."
msgstr "听说可以爬到纸箱上面。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006ef0
msgid "Rations taste great when you cook them golden brown."
msgstr "口粮烤到金黄时最好吃。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006f54
msgid "Soldiers accompanying tanks and armored vehicles couldn't care less about magazines."
msgstr "随坦克和装甲车行动的士兵根本不在乎杂志。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006fb8
msgid "The prisoner is safe. Somewhere nearby."
msgstr "俘虏安全。就在附近某处。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0070e4
msgid "I heard there are creatures called the Trenyas around here."
msgstr "听说这附近有种叫特雷尼亚的生物。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007148
msgid "People say there's a creature that will give you something if you know how to talk to it."
msgstr "据说有种生物，只要你会跟它说话，它就会给你东西。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007210
msgid "I came across these big-ass footprints in a swamp."
msgstr "我在沼泽里发现了巨大的脚印。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007274
msgid "If you... destroy the Chrysalis's radome..."
msgstr "如果你……摧毁蝶蛹天线罩……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0072d8
msgid "...it won't be able to dodge missiles or RPGs."
msgstr "……它就无法躲导弹或火箭筒。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00733c
msgid "Up in the trees... There's nothing up there. No fruit or nothing."
msgstr "树上……什么都没有。没果子也没别的。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0073a0
msgid "A weapon with high penetrative power will pierce a helmet."
msgstr "穿透力高的武器能打穿头盔。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007530
msgid "I'll send HQ a bogus report for you."
msgstr "我替你给总部发假报告。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007724
msgid "You won't find what you're looking for around here."
msgstr "在这附近你找不到想要的东西。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0079e0
msgid "I saw this strange-looking cardboard box around here."
msgstr "我在附近看到一个奇怪的纸箱。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007c38
msgid "There's... another guard besides me around here."
msgstr "这附近……除了我还有另一个守卫。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007c9c
msgid "There are... two more guards besides me around here."
msgstr "这附近……除了我还有两个守卫。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007d00
msgid "There are... three more guards besides me around here."
msgstr "这附近……除了我还有三个守卫。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007d64
msgid "There are... four more guards besides me around here."
msgstr "这附近……除了我还有四个守卫。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007dc8
msgid "There are... five more guards besides me around here."
msgstr "这附近……除了我还有五个守卫。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007e2c
msgid "Heroes will always attract soldiers..."
msgstr "英雄总能吸引士兵……"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007e90
msgid "Try giving a friend a call if you ever get stuck."
msgstr "卡关时不妨给朋友打个电话。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007ef4
msgid "Use the radio if you run into a problem."
msgstr "遇到麻烦就用无线电。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007f58
msgid "You can break a high fall by landing in straw."
msgstr "落稻草上能减轻坠落伤害。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x007fbc
msgid "Some weapons can unleash some heavy firepower if you have the people to help you."
msgstr "有人手帮忙的话，某些武器能发挥强大火力。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008020
msgid "They say you can change all sorts of settings under OPTIONS."
msgstr "据说在 OPTIONS 里能改各种设置。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008084
msgid "Enemy Search is good for scouting."
msgstr "敌人搜索适合侦察。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0080e8
msgid "Check your map."
msgstr "查看地图。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00814c
msgid "The more you use a weapon, the easier it'll be to exploit its full potential."
msgstr "武器用得越多，越容易发挥它的全部潜力。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0081b0
msgid ""
"If you wanna get to grips with a weapon fast,\n"
"go for headshots."
msgstr "想快速上手武器，\n就爆头吧。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008214
msgid "A person's codename reflects their play style."
msgstr "代号反映一个人的玩法。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008278
msgid "Your heroism will rise as your acquire more insignias."
msgstr "获得的勋章越多，英雄度越高。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0082dc
msgid "A tranq round will slowly take effect over time."
msgstr "麻醉弹会随时间慢慢生效。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008340
msgid "An analyzer will tell you all sorts of information."
msgstr "分析仪能告诉你各种信息。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0083a4
msgid "Some soldiers possess special skills."
msgstr "有些士兵拥有特殊技能。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008408
msgid "Every weapon has a critical rate."
msgstr "所有武器都有暴击率。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x00846c
msgid "Damage triples when you deliver a critical hit."
msgstr "暴击时伤害变为三倍。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0084d0
msgid "Handguns have high critical rates."
msgstr "手枪的暴击率很高。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008534
msgid "I heard... some of the prisoners are women."
msgstr "听说……俘虏里有女人。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008598
msgid "The butt... is another weak point."
msgstr "枪托……也是弱点。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0085fc
msgid "If the combined weight of your weapons is too heavy... your camo index will go down."
msgstr "武器总重量过重……迷彩指数会下降。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008660
msgid "The weapon you have equipped... changes your camo index."
msgstr "装备的武器……会改变迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0086c4
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008728
