#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x0089e4
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008a48
msgid "I-I'll show you where the classified doc is."
msgstr "我、我告诉你机密文件在哪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008aac
msgid "If you walk slowly, you can get close to the enemy without them hearing you."
msgstr "慢慢走就能不被敌人发现地靠近。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008b10
msgid "Pushing the START button will open the menu window."
msgstr "按 START 键打开菜单窗口。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008b74
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008bd8
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008c3c
