#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008d68
msgid "I-I'll show you where the equipment is."
msgstr "我、我告诉你装备在哪。"

#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x008dcc
msgid "I'm...a prisoner!"
msgstr "我是俘虏！"

